 "issues": [
  "u62-u73: page-4 table lists benchmark codes (SS2.1.1 ... SS12.1.5) only; labeled backup by column band.",
  "Benchmark tables: table header cells (End of Grade 2/5/8, Upon Graduation, Grade 12) and strand label cells (Spatial, Physical Place and Region, Human Place and Movement, Environment and Society) are split across rows/columns in extraction; labeled standards by column band (C1 K-2, C2 3-5, C3 6-8, C4 9-12). Their R/C order is row-wise so ranges are broken into many labels.",
  "Cells reading 'Not assessed at this' / 'time.' / 'Assessed in SSx.y.z' (e.g. u167, u171, u179-u180, u183-u184, u248, u261, u320, u324-u325, u390, u394, u543, u547) are placeholders where no benchmark exists for that band; labeled standards for the column band.",
  "Several benchmark cells contain appended ELA/CV/FPA/science cross-curricular codes and tracked-change remnants (e.g. u232 'SS.5.2.1', u245 'Identify and d Describe', u246 'Examine and e Evaluate', u262 'tensions between among'); strikethrough/blue-insert formatting lost, so deleted 2014 text and added 2018 text appear together.",
  "Performance Level Descriptors (units after each 'Performance Level Descriptor(s)' heading) are assessment descriptors, labeled backup by band (Grade 2 -> K-2, 5 -> 3-5, 8 -> 6-8, 12 -> 9-12). Some descriptor units run two grades' Advanced/Proficient/Basic text together in one unit; assignment follows the leading GRADE marker.",
  "u135 is statutory text, labeled backup (u134 rationale is examples, K-12). u149 and similar: 12th-grade cells contain both parent benchmark and its 2018 'a' addition in one unit.",
  "Glossary (u574-u708) labeled backup including its examples; u702-u706 'Secondary Source' examples list separate. u638, u715, u717 and other empty units are blank lines in the extraction.",
  "u81/u76: 2018 additions are marked with suffix 'a' (e.g. SS8.5.2a) within cells; no separate additions section exists, so additions are labeled with their benchmark (standards)."
 ]
}